# Final Cut, the screens after the bank 7 block ($A66D-$F76C), in place (banks 2 and 0 while it runs).

@module fcscreens ; the screens
@about Three plain screens (6912 bytes each) FinalCut copies to $4000: the caption shown first, the alien for the scroll (the normal screen's half of it) and the Victory screen at the end.
$A66D b AlienMagentaScreen ; the alien in magenta: the normal screen during the scroll
@res pictures/alien-magenta.scr
$C16D b CaptionScreen ; the caption (Russian): "after long fierce battles the human army has at last destroyed the Insignians' base. Now their race is destroyed!", the burning base
@res pictures/caption.scr
$DC6D b VictoryScreen ; "Victory is with U!!!": the V-sign
@res pictures/victory.scr
